<http://data.silknow.org/object/892cd875-5b6a-36d8-8b13-04b1ac2223e6/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Rectangular embroidered silk satin panel. Golden-yellow satin heavily embroidered with gold thread and coloured silks mainly inlaid and couched work and split stitch. Round the border is the wave pattern found round the hems of Chinese Court robes. The centre of the panel is occupied by a five-clawed dragon encircling a sacred pearl. Converging on the centre from all sides are eight dragons."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/892cd875-5b6a-36d8-8b13-04b1ac2223e6> .

